#
#1. Run initialization command:
srun -ppdebug -n4 ./<path-to-mgmol-build>/tests/TDDFTinit -c mgmol_init.cfg -i coords.in >! tddft_init.out

#2. Run TDDFT command:
srun -ppdebug -n4 ./<path-to-mgmol-build>/tests/TDDFTrun -c tddft.cfg >! tddft_run.out

Driver will generate:
* outfile.txt, containing a space separated output of some quantities interest.
* dipole_trace.dat, containing the trace of the dipole moment in time.